flowchart TD
    classDef student fill:#DBEAFE,stroke:#333;
    classDef teacher fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#333;
    classDef staff fill:#EDE9FE,stroke:#333;
    classDef ai fill:#FFEDD5,stroke:#333;
    classDef backend fill:#E0F2FE,stroke:#333;
    classDef alert fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#333;

    Start([學生登入]) --> Portfolio[建立學習成果]:::student
    Portfolio --> Evidence[上傳檔案或作品連結]:::student
    Evidence --> Snapshot[保存成果要求快照]:::backend
    Snapshot --> AI[AI 初步比對佐證與缺件]:::ai
    AI --> Teacher[教師查看學生資料與 AI 提示]:::teacher
    Teacher --> Feedback[留下輔導或補件建議]:::teacher
    Feedback --> NeedFix{是否需要補件?}
    NeedFix -- 是 --> Revise[學生補件並提交新版本]:::student
    Revise --> Snapshot
    NeedFix -- 否 --> Complete[保存教師確認紀錄]:::backend
    Complete --> End([完成])
